Z||000000||Au nrod||06-18-2001||05:11 PM||||Everyone  -  don't forget the show next <BR>Saturday, June 23rd in Wooster, Ohio. The<P>F iero I ncredible E xtrvaganza R ound O hio<P>is to be on the campus at Ohio State University O.A.R.D.S. in Wooster, Ohio starting at 8AM, judging (by outside judges) to start at 10AM, and awards about 4PM.<P>All you people that are going to the Mid-Ohio track, just come a day early, come to our show  - which is just up the road a bit from Mid-Ohio  -  and join the Fiero Fun. <P>So all you Ohioians, and all you Fiero owners from the surrounding states, and all you Fiero loves in the mid west, come on over, bring your beautiful machine and join the fun.<P>For further information you can E-mail me or Margi at <A HREF="http://www.dawdys@valkyrie.net." TARGET=_blank>www.dawdys@valkyrie.net.</A>  it will be good to see you all.<P><BR>||||reg||1
