Z||000019||Au nrod||06-21-2001||04:01 PM||||o.k. gang  - directions to the show. agreed, free ways no fun  -  but the easiest way to get there. off I-71 take the US-30 exit, exit no. 176 towards MANSFIELD/WOOSTER. you want to go 'east' on US-30. go about 25 miles and take the MADISON AVE. exit. your going south about 7 or 8 blocks to 1680 MADISON AVE, WOOSTER, OHIO. the campus is located at the intersections of ROUTE 83 & 250 SOUTH. can't miss it. look of 'fiero signs'<P> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by 007DOUG:<BR><B>I'll go, if someone can tell me how to get there.<P>I can get myself to Wooster. Where's the OSU campus?<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||1
