Z||000022||rogergarrison||06-21-2001||10:33 PM||||just supposed to be slight chance of scattered rain. Ill be coming up 83, thats an awsome road to drive on. I dont think theres a 1/4 mile of straight road on the whole thing.<P>Doug, when you come or go back, take 83 south - goes all the way to I-70 just west of Cambridge. I quarantee youll love it. If you come up 83 its the New Concord exit. goes all the way rite to Wooster. Runs rite into 250. I usually run it 70-80 but watch for some really wicked curves.<p>[This message has been edited by rogergarrison (edited 06-21-2001).]||||reg||1
